# Upstream engine pin — main-tracking dev feed.
#
# This fork's `dev` packages (0.19.1-dev.* prereleases on GitHub Packages) are built against the
# LadybugDB/ladybug engine SOURCE at the commit below. It normally rides upstream `main` (ahead of
# releases); right now it is pinned AT the v0.19.1 release commit, so the dev feed and the stable
# release track the same engine. Advance this pin with the runbook in docs/upstream-sync.md.
#
# The STABLE/release package family is INDEPENDENT of this file: it is pinned by version.txt to the
# latest published engine RELEASE (currently v0.19.1) and ships prebuilt release natives.
#
# Format: key=value, one per line. Consumed by .github/workflows/github-packages-dev.yml and
# scripts/build-native-from-pin.ps1.

repo=LadybugDB/ladybug
commit=554c1e71158564c37a30c541a92bfc9eddc96430
describe=v0.19.1
engine_version=0.19.1
capi_stable_since=v0.19.1
updated=2026-08-18
note=Pinned AT the v0.19.1 release (554c1e71). C API header adds lbug_connection_get_pushed_sql over v0.18.0; structs/enums are unchanged. 110 commits over the previous pin (0cda4fff), including pushed-down SQL inspection, attach/foreign-scan fixes, Arrow UUID/MAP fixes, COPY auto_checkpoint fix, WAL/read-only checkpoint hardening, and histogram/percentile/date-part additions. Extension ABI is 0.19.0.
# consumer_impact: one-line, structured summary of what THIS pin changes for downstream consumers
# (e.g. Graphiti), so they don't re-derive it each cycle. Required on every bump (see docs/upstream-sync.md).
# Fields: interop=<none|...>; fts_scoring=<...>; new_ddl=<...>; fixes=<...>; note=<...>
consumer_impact=interop=added:lbug_connection_get_pushed_sql; fts_scoring=re-verify (extension ABI 0.19.0, source-built/shipped by dev feed); new_ddl=NONE; fixes=attach/foreign-scan routing,Arrow UUID endpoint + MAP schema export,COPY auto_checkpoint,read-only checkpoint open,WAL forward-compatible replay,recursive-shortest node filtering; note=Graphiti can use Connection.GetPushedSql once restored against 0.19.1-dev packages
